  abstract={In order to effectively reduce noise interference and improve the risk of an arrow remote data error in the local system, an improved iterative algorithm based on EEMD wavelet is proposed in this paper. The EEMD algorithm is used to break up the evo-remote data into a series of data for removing the noise signals. This algorithm has good noise reduction effect.},
  keywords={Rockets;Filters;Noise reduction;Interference;Control systems;Iterative methods;High frequency;Signal to noise ratio;EEMD wavelet;the arrow remote data;Noise reduction effect},
