  volume={},
  number={},
  pages={459-463},
  abstract={With the continuous development of space technology and the explosive growth of satellites, space system is developing towards the direction of complex networking, integrated operation and intelligent service. How to build an intelligent and integrated space measurement and operation control network has become a key issue for the future development of space measurement and operation control network in China. In order to solve this problem, we first analyze the development status of aerospace measurement and operation control network at home and abroad, and summarize and analyze the common problems and challenges of aerospace measurement and operation control network facing the development of intelligent integration. On this basis, this paper gives the understanding of the connotation of intelligent integrated measurement, operation and control network, and designs the architecture of intelligent integrated measurement, operation and control network, and then discusses some key technical problems to be solved in the future construction of intelligent integrated measurement, operation and control network.},
